      'A hint shows the next push in a shortest solution. It can help when you are uncertain which box must move first. Hints and undo do not replace the basic rule: plan your standing position as carefully as the crate destination. A move can place a box on a useful square but still leave you unable to push it again.',
      '## Keep the board visible on a phone',
