      'A piece may be locked or fixed in place. Check its visual indicator before planning to rotate it. If the route seems blocked, search for another path around it rather than spending time trying to change a piece that cannot move. The [Pipe Connect rules and controls](/blogs/how-to-play-pipe-connect) explain the tile types.',
