      'Rotate a pipe by tapping it or clicking it. On desktop, select a tile and press Space or Enter. Each rotation changes the pipe’s orientation by a quarter turn. Watch the connection indicators after each action and verify that the source is still linked toward the target. A correct-looking tile can have the wrong exit direction.',
